    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ba62de63-ee73-5b13-ad57-1c6719332d02" activityNameId="b04a679a-7e0c-57f1-bd40-d36106f281c4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">560 kWp open ground installation, single-Si, on open ground</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 560 kWp open ground installation, single-Si, on open ground
Photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 560kWp and a life time of 30 years installed in Switzerland. The efficiency of single-Si PV modules is 17.9% (Fraunhofer ISE Photovoltaics Report 2019). The share of rejected or replaced PV modules is estimated at 3%. The inverter is assumed to be replaced once during the service life of the PV system.;
Synonyms: monocrystalline, single crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: 7d04468e-682b-3d6d-822d-1ce03bf29a8d
All components (modules, mounting system, electric installation, inverter) for the installation of a 560 kWp photovoltaic plant, energy use for the mounting, transport of materials to the place of installation. Disposal of components after end of life.
Location: Installation in CH
Technology: Current technology for mounting of panels or laminates, electric installations and other components.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Study by Frischknecht et al. (1996) 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7d04468e-682b-3d6d-822d-1ce03bf29a8d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
